{"id":"n42135-1-8","stage":4,"title":"눈초리 · 眼尾","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42135-1-8-1","ko":"너는 눈초리가 많이 올라가 있구나.","zh":"你的眼尾挺上挑的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"눈초리가","meaning":"眼尾，眼梢","explanation":"눈초리：眼尾，眼梢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈초리","audio":"/audio/d422da4fd59f6f634a8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42135","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈초리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈초리가","audio":"/audio/443004271b036458514c.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"올라가","meaning":"上，上行，向上","explanation":"올라가다：上，上行，向上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"8","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라가","audio":"/audio/fd5060bc3d210cbd835e.mp3"}},{"text":"있구나.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있구나","audio":"/audio/3c733fab5c5eaabdc37c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d422da4fd59f